# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.

## Firebase web app config (Firebase console → Project settings → General → Your apps)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

## Service-account JSON on ONE line (Project settings → Service accounts → Generate new private key)
## SECRET — grants full admin access to the Firebase project
FIREBASE_SA=

## Account to grant admin access to when running `npm run set-admin` (local only)
ADMIN_EMAIL=
